bar-aria-label\" data-v-f14c4045=\"\"> Sidebar Navigation </span><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><div class=\"no-transition group\" data-v-fd2cbcf3=\"\"><section class=\"VPSidebarItem level-0 has-active\" data-v-fd2cbcf3=\"\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><div class=\"item\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><div class=\"indicator\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"></div><h2 class=\"text\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\">Guide</h2><!----></div><div class=\"items\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><!--[--><div class=\"VPSidebarItem level-1 is-link is-active has-active\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><div class=\"item\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><div class=\"indicator\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"></div><a class=\"VPLink link link\" href=\"/smartclass-dispatchub/guide/getting-started\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><!--[--><p class=\"text\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\">Getting Started</p><!--]--></a><!----></div><!----></div><div class=\"VPSidebarItem level-1 is-link\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><div class=\"item\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><div class=\"indicator\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"></div><a class=\"VPLink link link\" href=\"/smartclass-dispatchub/guide/deploy\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><!--[--><p class=\"text\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\">Deployment</p><!--]--></a><!----></div><!----></div><div class=\"VPSidebarItem level-1 is-link\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><div class=\"item\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><div class=\"indicator\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"></div><a class=\"VPLink link link\" href=\"/smartclass-dispatchub/guide/permissions\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><!--[--><p class=\"text\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\">Permissions</p><!--]--></a><!----></div><!----></div><div class=\"VPSidebarItem level-1 is-link\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><div class=\"item\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><div class=\"indicator\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"></div><a class=\"VPLink link link\" href=\"/smartclass-dispatchub/guide/api-usage\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><!--[--><p class=\"text\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\">API Usage</p><!--]--></a><!----></div><!----></div><div class=\"VPSidebarItem level-1 is-link\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><div class=\"item\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><div class=\"indicator\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"></div><a class=\"VPLink link link\" href=\"/smartclass-dispatchub/guide/operations\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\"><!--[--><p class=\"text\" data-v-eb85ecf7=\"\">Operations</p><!--]--></a><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--></div></section></div><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></nav></aside><div class=\"VPContent has-sidebar\" id=\"VPContent\" data-v-51608ad5=\"\" data-v-22444a1e=\"\"><div class=\"VPDoc has-sidebar has-aside\" data-v-22444a1e=\"\" data-v-a3d537d1=\"\"><!--[--><!--]--><div class=\"container\" data-v-a3d537d1=\"\"><div class=\"aside\" data-v-a3d537d1=\"\"><div class=\"aside-curtain\" data-v-a3d537d1=\"\"></div><div class=\"aside-container\" data-v-a3d537d1=\"\"><div class=\"aside-content\" data-v-a3d537d1=\"\"><div class=\"VPDocAside\" data-v-a3d537d1=\"\" data-v-871b5275=\"\"><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--><nav aria-labelledby=\"doc-outline-aria-label\" class=\"VPDocAsideOutline has-outline\" data-v-871b5275=\"\" data-v-d607fa03=\"\"><div class=\"content\" data-v-d607fa03=\"\"><div class=\"outline-marker\" data-v-d607fa03=\"\" style=\"top: 33px; opacity: 0;\"></div><div aria-level=\"2\" class=\"outline-title\" id=\"doc-outline-aria-label\" role=\"heading\" data-v-d607fa03=\"\">On this page</div><ul class=\"VPDocOutlineItem root\" data-v-d607fa03=\"\" data-v-41a17517=\"\"><!--[--><li data-v-41a17517=\"\"><a data-v-41a17517=\"\" class=\"outline-link\" href=\"#prerequisites\" title=\"Prerequisites\">Prerequisites</a><!----></li><li data-v-41a17517=\"\"><a data-v-41a17517=\"\" class=\"outline-link\" href=\"#build\" title=\"Build\">Build</a><!----></li><li data-v-41a17517=\"\"><a data-v-41a17517=\"\" class=\"outline-link\" href=\"#configure\" title=\"Configure\">Configure</a><!----></li><li data-v-41a17517=\"\"><a data-v-41a17517=\"\" class=\"outline-link\" href=\"#start\" title=\"Start\">Start</a><!----></li><li data-v-41a17517=\"\"><a data-v-41a17517=\"\" class=\"outline-link\" href=\"#get-an-access-token\" title=\"Get an access token\">Get an access token</a><!----></li><li data-v-41a17517=\"\"><a data-v-41a17517=\"\" class=\"outline-link\" href=\"#_1-create-a-term\" title=\"1. Create a term\">1. Create a term</a><!----></li><li data-v-41a17517=\"\"><a data-v-41a17517=\"\" class=\"outline-link\" href=\"#_2-define-the-节次-time-table\" title=\"2. Define the 节次 time table\">2. Define the 节次 time table</a><!----></li><li data-v-41a17517=\"\"><a data-v-41a17517=\"\" class=\"outline-link\" href=\"#_3-bind-a-room\" title=\"3. Bind a room\">3. Bind a room</a><!----></li><li data-v-41a17517=\"\"><a data-v-41a17517=\"\" class=\"outline-link\" href=\"#_4-import-the-timetable\" title=\"4. Import the timetable\">4. Import the timetable</a><!----></li><li data-v-41a17517=\"\"><a data-v-41a17517=\"\" class=\"outline-link\" href=\"#_5-record-a-room\" title=\"5. Record a room\">5. Record a room</a><!----></li><li data-v-41a17517=\"\"><a data-v-41a17517=\"\" class=\"outline-link\" href=\"#next-steps\" title=\"Next steps\">Next steps</a><!----></li><!--]--></ul></div></nav><!--[--><!--]--><div class=\"spacer\" data-v-871b5275=\"\"></div><!--[--><!--]--><!----><!--[--><!--]--><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div></div><div class=\"content\" data-v-a3d537d1=\"\"><div class=\"content-container\" data-v-a3d537d1=\"\"><!--[--><!--]--><main class=\"main\" data-v-a3d537d1=\"\"><div style=\"position:relative;\" class=\"vp-doc _smartclass-dispatchub_guide_getting-started\" data-v-a3d537d1=\"\"><div><h1 id=\"getting-started\" tabindex=\"-1\">Getting Started <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#getting-started\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;Getting Started&quot;\">​</a></h1><p>This guide takes a source checkout to a locally running dispatchub that imports a timetable and records one room. The minimum setup is one PostgreSQL database, a teamusers instance, and a reachable smartclass-webcam-server with at least one connected device. For a first look you can replace teamusers with <code>DISPATCH_DEV=true</code>.</p><h2 id=\"prerequisites\" tabindex=\"-1\">Prerequisites <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#prerequisites\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;Prerequisites&quot;\">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Go 1.26 or newer</strong> (build host only).</li><li><strong>PostgreSQL 16 or newer.</strong> dispatchub owns one database and applies its embedded goose migrations itself; no external migration tool is required. Everything it creates lives in the <code>smartclass_dispatchub</code> schema, never in <code>public</code>.</li><li><strong>A teamusers instance.</strong> Operators sign in there, and permission decisions are resolved against it on every request. The nine <code>dispatch:*</code> keys must be registered in its catalog; see <a href=\"/smartclass-dispatchub/guide/permissions\">Permissions and access control</a>.</li><li><strong>A smartclass-webcam-server instance</strong> with a registered, online device. dispatchub only <em>reads</em> devices and sends commands; device provisioning stays with webcam-server.</li></ul><h2 id=\"build\" tabindex=\"-1\">Build <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#build\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;Build&quot;\">​</a></h2><div class=\"language-sh vp-adaptive-theme\"><button title=\"Copy Code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">sh</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">go</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> build</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -trimpath</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -o</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> dispatchub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> ./cmd/dispatchub</span></span></code></pre></div><p>The subcommands are <code>run</code>, <code>migrate</code>, <code>status</code>, <code>doctor</code> and <code>register-permissions</code>. <code>status</code> prints the redacted configuration, and <code>doctor</code> runs the same checks with a 30-second timeout and exits non-zero when a check fails.</p><h2 id=\"configure\" tabindex=\"-1\">Configure <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#configure\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;Configure&quot;\">​</a></h2><p>The service reads everything from the environment (a <code>.env</code> file is loaded only when <code>DISPATCH_ENV_FILE</code> points at one). A minimal local setup:</p><div class=\"language-sh vp-adaptive-theme\"><button title=\"Copy Code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">sh</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\"> DISPATCH_DSN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">'postgres://dispatchub:dispatchub@127.0.0.1:5432/dispatchub?sslmode=disable'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\"> DISPATCH_TEAMUSERS_URL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">'http://127.0.0.1:8082'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\"> DISPATCH_TEAMUSERS_CLIENT_ID</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">'dispatchub-svc'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\"> DISPATCH_TEAMUSERS_CLIENT_SECRET</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">'...'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\"> DISPATCH_WEBCAM_URL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">'http://127.0.0.1:8080'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Every variable, its default and its meaning is listed in the <a href=\"/smartclass-dispatchub/guide/deploy#configuration\">deployment guide</a>. Two values are easy to get wrong on day one:</p><ul><li><code>DISPATCH_TEAMUSERS_AUD</code> must equal the audience the issuer mints (the fleet convention is <code>nekostick</code>, not <code>teamusers</code>).</li><li><code>DISPATCH_TIMEZONE</code> (default <code>Asia/Shanghai</code>) is what turns <code>(date, period)</code> rows into instants; a wrong value silently schedules the whole term at the wrong time.</li></ul><p>For a throwaway run without teamusers, set <code>DISPATCH_DEV=true</code>: the service injects synthetic claims and skips the issuer entirely. Never enable it on a reachable host.</p><h2 id=\"start\" tabindex=\"-1\">Start <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#start\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;Start&quot;\">​</a></h2><div class=\"language-sh vp-adaptive-theme\"><button title=\"Copy Code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">sh</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">createdb</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> dispatchub</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">./dispatchub</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> run</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>run</code> applies the embedded migrations (<code>./dispatchub migrate</code> applies them without starting the server) and listens on <code>DISPATCH_LISTEN_ADDR</code>, <code>:8081</code> by default.</p><div class=\"language-sh vp-adaptive-theme\"><button title=\"Copy Code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">sh</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -sS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> http://127.0.0.1:8081/healthz</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;\">   # liveness, always 200 while the process lives</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -sS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> http://127.0.0.1:8081/readyz</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;\">    # Postgres ping + webcam-server /readyz</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"get-an-access-token\" tabindex=\"-1\">Get an access token <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#get-an-access-token\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;Get an access token&quot;\">​</a></h2><p>With a real teamusers instance:</p><div class=\"language-sh vp-adaptive-theme\"><button title=\"Copy Code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">sh</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\"> BASE_URL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">'http://127.0.0.1:8081'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">export</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\"> TOKEN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">\"$(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -sS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -X</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> POST \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$DISPATCH_TEAMUSERS_URL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">/auth/login\" </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">\\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> 'Content-Type: application/json' </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">\\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> '{\"username\":\"operator\",\"password\":\"...\"}' </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\"> jq</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -r</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> .access_token)\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>With <code>DISPATCH_DEV=true</code> no <code>Authorization</code> header is needed, so the <code>curl</code> calls below work without <code>-H \"Authorization: Bearer $TOKEN\"</code>.</p><h2 id=\"_1-create-a-term\" tabindex=\"-1\">1. Create a term <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#_1-create-a-term\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;1. Create a term&quot;\">​</a></h2><p>A term is a <code>term_code</code>, a display name, the Monday of teaching week 1 and the number of teaching weeks (1-30):</p><div class=\"language-sh vp-adaptive-theme\"><button title=\"Copy Code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">sh</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -sS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -X</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> POST</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$BASE_URL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">/api/v1/terms\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"Authorization: Bearer </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$TOKEN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> 'Content-Type: application/json'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> '{\"term_code\":\"2026-FALL\",\"name\":\"2026 秋季学期\",\"week1_monday\":\"2026-09-07\",\"weeks\":16}'</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"_2-define-the-节次-time-table\" tabindex=\"-1\">2. Define the 节次 time table <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#_2-define-the-节次-time-table\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;2. Define the 节次 time table&quot;\">​</a></h2><p>Periods belong to a term and replace the whole set on every <code>PUT</code>. Each entry maps a period number (1-20) to its wall-clock start and end, in <code>DISPATCH_TIMEZONE</code>:</p><div class=\"language-sh vp-adaptive-theme\"><button title=\"Copy Code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">sh</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -sS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -X</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> PUT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$BASE_URL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">/api/v1/terms/2026-FALL/periods\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"Authorization: Bearer </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$TOKEN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> 'Content-Type: application/json'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> '{\"periods\":[</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">    {\"period_no\":1,\"start_time\":\"08:00\",\"end_time\":\"08:45\"},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">    {\"period_no\":2,\"start_time\":\"08:55\",\"end_time\":\"09:40\"},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">    {\"period_no\":3,\"start_time\":\"10:00\",\"end_time\":\"10:45\"},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">    {\"period_no\":4,\"start_time\":\"10:55\",\"end_time\":\"11:40\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">  ]}'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>An import that touches a period the term has not configured is rejected with <code>periods_not_configured</code>. <code>PUT</code> answers <code>200</code> with the replaced set in the usual <code>{\"items\": [...]}</code> envelope, and a <code>GET</code> on the same route returns the same list (or <code>periods_not_configured</code> when the term has none).</p><h2 id=\"_3-bind-a-room\" tabindex=\"-1\">3. Bind a room <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#_3-bind-a-room\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;3. Bind a room&quot;\">​</a></h2><p>A binding maps the timetable's <code>room_code</code> to one camera on one webcam-server device. dispatchub verifies the device through <code>GET /api/devices/{device_id}/</code> and snapshots its <code>team_id</code>/<code>owner_id</code> for scoped permissions:</p><div class=\"language-sh vp-adaptive-theme\"><button title=\"Copy Code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">sh</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -sS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -X</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> PUT</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$BASE_URL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">/api/v1/rooms/A301\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"Authorization: Bearer </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$TOKEN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> 'Content-Type: application/json'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -d</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> '{\"device_id\":\"01J8Z4W3K5M7Q9R1T3V5X7Z9B1\",\"camera_enum\":0,\"name\":\"A301 教室\"}'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>camera_enum</code> is the camera number the device reports (<code>GET /api/devices/{device_id}/</code> lists them). Binding the same <code>(device_id, camera_enum)</code> twice is rejected. The body also accepts an optional <code>\"enabled\": false</code> to keep the binding but make imports treat the room as unbound (<code>room_not_bound</code>) until it is re-enabled.</p><p>A binding can only be deleted while nothing references it: once the room appears in timetable entries or session history, <code>DELETE /api/v1/rooms/{room_code}</code> answers <code>409 room_has_history</code> and the room should be disabled instead (<code>PUT</code> with <code>\"enabled\": false</code>), which takes it out of scheduling while keeping the historical rows readable. That flip works at any time, history or not.</p><h2 id=\"_4-import-the-timetable\" tabindex=\"-1\">4. Import the timetable <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#_4-import-the-timetable\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;4. Import the timetable&quot;\">​</a></h2><p>The CSV has one row per (course, room, weekday, period range, weeks) and this required header, matched by name in any order:</p><div class=\"language-csv vp-adaptive-theme\"><button title=\"Copy Code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">csv</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">term_code,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">course_code,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">course_name,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;\">teacher_username,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">room_code,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70;\">weekday,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">period_start,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">period_end,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold;\">weeks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">2026-FALL,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">CS101,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">数据结构,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;\">zhangsan,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">A301,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70;\">1,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">1,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">2,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold;\">\"1-16\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">2026-FALL,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">CS101,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">数据结构,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;\">zhangsan,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">A301,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70;\">3,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">3,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">4,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold;\">\"1-16\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">2026-FALL,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583;\">MA201,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">高等数学,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D;\">lisi,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">B102,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70;\">5,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">5,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">6,</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold;\">\"1-8,10-16\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Always dry-run first: validation reports every row error, writes nothing but the batch row, and answers <code>200</code> with the import plus a preview of the first/last occurrence per row.</p><div class=\"language-sh vp-adaptive-theme\"><button title=\"Copy Code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">sh</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -sS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -X</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> POST</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$BASE_URL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">/api/v1/timetable/imports?dry_run=true&amp;mode=replace\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"Authorization: Bearer </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$TOKEN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -F</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> 'file=@timetable.csv'</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Then repeat the call without <code>dry_run=true</code> to commit (answers <code>201</code> with the import). A commit is one transaction: batch, entries and the expanded <code>sessions</code> all land together, and any blocking row error answers <code>422</code> with the full error list and no partial commit. <code>mode=append</code> keeps the term's existing entries; the default <code>replace</code> supersedes them and cancels their future <code>planned</code> sessions. Re-uploading an identical file answers <code>409 duplicate_import</code> unless <code>?force=true</code>.</p><p>Verify what was materialized:</p><div class=\"language-sh vp-adaptive-theme\"><button title=\"Copy Code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">sh</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -sS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$BASE_URL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">/api/v1/sessions?term_code=2026-FALL\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"Authorization: Bearer </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$TOKEN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"_5-record-a-room\" tabindex=\"-1\">5. Record a room <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#_5-record-a-room\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;5. Record a room&quot;\">​</a></h2><p>Ad-hoc control works without any schedule:</p><div class=\"language-sh vp-adaptive-theme\"><button title=\"Copy Code\" class=\"copy\"></button><span class=\"lang\">sh</span><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark vp-code\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -sS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -X</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> POST</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$BASE_URL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">/api/v1/rooms/A301/recording/start\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"Authorization: Bearer </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$TOKEN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0;\">curl</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -sS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> -X</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> POST</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$BASE_URL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">/api/v1/rooms/A301/recording/stop\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;\">  -H</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\"> \"Authorization: Bearer </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;\">$TOKEN</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF;\">\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>The start call asks webcam-server to start <code>camera_enum</code> on the bound device and stores the returned <code>stream_id</code> on a new <code>manual</code> session. <code>GET /api/v1/sessions/{id}/artifacts</code> then lists the recording's segments and photos with freshly minted download URLs. Scheduled sessions need no call at all: the scheduler starts them <code>DISPATCH_PRESTART</code> before <code>starts_at</code> and stops them at <code>ends_at</code>.</p><h2 id=\"next-steps\" tabindex=\"-1\">Next steps <a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#next-steps\" aria-label=\"Permalink to &quot;Next steps&quot;\">​</a></h2><ul><li><a href=\"/smartclass-dispatchub/guide/deploy\">Deployment</a> - the fleet compose file and the full configuration reference.</li><li><a href=\"/smartclass-dispatchub/guide/permissions\">Permissions</a> - registering the <code>dispatch:*</code> keys and the scope ladder.</li><li><a href=\"/smartclass-dispatchub/guide/api-usage\">API Usage</a> - the full import-to-artifacts walkthrough and mid-session calls.</li><li><a href=\"/smartclass-dispatchub/guide/operations\">Operations</a> - scheduler semantics, <code>missed</code>/<code>failed</code> triage, outages.</li></ul></div></div></main><footer class=\"VPDocFooter\" data-v-a3d537d1=\"\" data-v-aace3ab5=\"\"><!--[--><!--]--><div class=\"edit-info\" data-v-aace3ab5=\"\"><!----><div class=\"last-updated\" data-v-aace3ab5=\"\"><p class=\"VPLastUpdated\" data-v-aace3ab5=\"\" data-v-3104ff47=\"\">Last updated: <time datetime=\"2026-10-05T12:46:33.000Z\" data-v-3104ff47=\"\">10/5/26, 12:46 PM</time></p></div></div><nav class=\"prev-next\" aria-labelledby=\"doc-footer-aria-label\" data-v-aace3ab5=\"\"><span class=\"visually-hidden\" id=\"doc-footer-aria-label\" data-v-aace3ab5=\"\">Pager</span><div class=\"pager\" data-v-aace3ab5=\"\"><!----></div><div class=\"pager\" data-v-aace3ab5=\"\"><a class=\"VPLink link pager-link next\" href=\"/smartclass-dispatchub/guide/deploy\" data-v-aace3ab5=\"\"><!--[--><span class=\"desc\" data-v-aace3ab5=\"\">Next page</span><span class=\"title\" data-v-aace3ab5=\"\">Deployment</span><!--]--></a></div></nav></footer><!--[--><!--]--></div></div></div><!--[--><!--]--></div></div><!----><!--[--><!--]--></div></div>\n    <script>window.__VP_HASH_MAP__=JSON.parse(\"{\\\"api_ov